OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for beer keg attack
OL,4,Aat police station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted offences after a
OL,7,Fbeer keg was used to damage the front
OL,8,Fentrance of a police station, forcing
OL,9,Fits closure to the public.
OL,11,FThe attack on Saturday has left the
OL,12,Ffront of Daventry Police Station in
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire with boards over its
OL,14,Fmain entrance, and a defibrillator
OL,15,Fmounted on the building was also
OL,16,Fdamaged.
OL,18,FA 34-year-old man, who Northamptonshire
OL,19,FPolice did not want to name, has
OL,20,Fpleaded guilty to three counts of
OL,21,Fcriminal damage and two counts of
OL,22,Fattempted criminal damage.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
