OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for beer keg attack
OL,4,Aat police station
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing at Northampton Magistrates'
OL,7,FCourt on Monday, he received a 12-month
OL,8,Fjail sentence, suspended for a year, as
OL,9,Fwell being given a rehabilitation order
OL,10,Fand a fine of #2,772.
